        "url": "https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Tras%20el%20desalojo%20de%20playa%20Ben%C3%ADtez%20en%20Ceuta%2C%20decenas%20de%20migrantes%20regresan%20a%20Marruecos%2C%20seg%C3%BAn%20Antena%203%20y%20laSexta.%20elDiario.es%20cuestiona%20que%20esos%20retornos%20se%20califiquen%20de%20%C2%ABvoluntarios%C2%BB.%0A%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Hasta%20las%20comillas%20han%20tenido%20que%20pasar%20el%20control%20fronterizo."
